    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140SI0000",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Yggar\u0027s Shop",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140SI0000",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "My items are the best in the realm.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140SI0002",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_TITLE",
      "TEXT": "Thom\u0027s Slave Market",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140SI0002",
      "ID_STRING": "TXT_DESC",
      "TEXT": "Taken young and trained for you! They are yours to treat as you please for a price! NO refunds...",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Neutrals",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140PL0000",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "No race description",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140PL0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Isuel",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140PL0001",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "In her youth, this mighty lord once stood fast against an army from hell and single-handedly defeated them by sealing the gateway that spew them. She then became sovereign of her realm.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140PL0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Cillen",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140PL0002",
      "ID_STRING": "DESC_TXT",
      "TEXT": "A veteran in the struggle to reclaim Elven glory, nobody enters the forest without her knowledge.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140UN0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140UN0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Virgile",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140UN000c",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140UN000d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140UN000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140UN000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140UN0010",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140UN0015",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thug",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "- INTRO",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Serphis \n\u0022Temperance lies just ahead of us, but if we are to invade the lands of Fardale we will first need to solidify our hold on the Mercantile Sea and amass a force capable of dealing with the Empire on their own ground.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Serphis \n\u0022So far, we have managed to pull through victorious despite all the challenges placed before us. A sign of divine favor, certainly. I know you are not sailors, but Gallean will guide us in this task.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer \n\u0022And you are to lead the Centaurs? I doubt it...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Serphis \n\u0022Why do you insist on challenging our every move?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Strider \n\u0022Isn\u0027t it obvious by now? We do not follow the \u0027noble\u0027 order! Why should we answer to you?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Lancer \n\u0022You have refused to give due respect to Geintel. It\u0027s as if his death means nothing to you!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Serphis \n\u0022What??? Geintel\u0027s death hurts us all, I assure you! However, we simply do not have the time for ceremonies for one fallen brother when so many are dying each day! We will take time to honor our dead when we have finished.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 6
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Centaur Strider \n\u0022How can you expect us to follow your lead when you refuse to honor those who die at your side? Who speaks for us?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 7
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Serphis \n\u0022Your orders are not from me; your orders are from Gallean! Have you forgotten why we do this?! We must focus on destroying the Empire\u0027s trade route at once! There are three ports here - take them. I want the head of their fleet tender as well!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 8
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0000",
      "ID_STRING": "OBJECT_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Capture all three trading ports and destroy the Empire\u0027s fleet tender.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "CAPTURED DEVILS DEN",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thom Woodworth \n\u0022What? New owners? Don\u0027t give a damn as long as I have a place to sell my services. Keep my rent the same and I won\u0027t gripe.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022What do you offer as services?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thom Woodworth \n\u0022Haha, ya intrested? Well, we do the more discreet things...if you follow. We can get you goods, information or even make people disappear, thanks to our silent friend here!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Greiss \n\u0022...\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022A heretic! It follows your orders???\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0001",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Thom Woodworth \n\u0022Well, we got a special agreement me and him. He listens, I feed him. Plus I think he enjoys all the killin\u0027 and chaos.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 5
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "CAPTURED - BANTHER",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Banther \n\u0022Whaa...hey...ELVES!! Loooong time not seen forest people here, yeah...what brings you to Banther\u0027s? Ahh...you need goods? Ohhhohoho Banther got em ALL!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022No, we are taking over the trade here, Human!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Banther \n\u0022TAKING OVER??? Yaaah...oh...Oh!! You mean you\u0027re replacing the Empire...GOOD!!! Those bastards just bad...they take and take and take and, well...that\u0027s it, they just take! No good business with them.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0002",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Banther \n\u0022Ohh...HA! You can be sure Banther will support you; he sees only good things from this, in fact...Here! Goods on me! Aren\u0027t I just perfect!? Oh yes I am!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "CAPTURED - SHADYA",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bramdock \n\u0022So it\u0027s true! Yataa\u0027 Halli must be dead then! A shame, really, she carried the royal bloodline. Dwarves \u0027round here didn\u0027t much care for her though. Peace this...negotiations that. It wasn\u0027t Wotan\u0027s way!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022Yes...well...we are taking over control of these trading lanes. What business do you run here?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bramdock \n\u0022Resources! All manner of minerals, iron, rocks and such! And not just from Dwarven mines, from all parts of Nevendaar. If someone is harvesting it, chances are we can get it for you! And at good prices!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 2
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "\u0022A Promising proposition, but we will leave some of our own here with you to work out the details. I trust you have no issues trading with Elves?\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 3
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV0003",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Bramdock \n\u0022Gold is my only real friend. Anything else is just...as you said...details. As long as you have no trouble with me being a Dwarf, I think we can work it out!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 4
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140UN002d",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mermaid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140UN002e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": null,
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
