      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Z - PLAYER WINS",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV000e",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Scout \n\u0022We have finally destroyed the Empire\u0027s fleet tender and have taken control of all the trading ports in Mercantile. Inform Serphis that we may start preparing our fleet for the invasion of Fardale.\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140UN0031",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Mermaid",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "NAME_TXT",
      "TEXT": "ENC - EMP ALERT",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Gealia \n\u0022We have just received information that the Empire is aware of our presence. They will surely try to take control of all remaining trading ports of Mercantile!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "POPUP_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Serphis \n\u0022We cannot allow this to happen! If all ports fall under Empire control, we will no longer be able to deal with them. Their hold will be too strong. We must hurry - take control of the ports and defend them!\u0022",
      "SEQ_NUM": 1
    },
    {
      "NO_SCEN": "S140SC0000",
      "ID_OBJECT": "S140EV000f",
      "ID_STRING": "OBJECT_TXT",
      "TEXT": "Take control of all Trading ports and defend them from the Empire. \n \nDefeat the Empire\u0027s fleet tender.\r \nDo not let the Empire gain control of all ports.",
      "SEQ_NUM": 0
    },
